MT-Bench human & GPT-4 judgments — data attribution
====================================================

The data files in this directory (`human.jsonl`, `gpt4_pair.jsonl`) are a
reformatted subset of the dataset:

    lmsys/mt_bench_human_judgments
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/lmsys/mt_bench_human_judgments

Copyright (c) LMSYS Org. Created by Zheng et al. (2023),
"Judging LLM-as-a-Judge with MT-Bench and Chatbot Arena", arXiv:2306.05685.

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC-BY-4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made: only the label/key columns were kept
(`question_id`, `model_a`, `model_b`, `winner`, `judge`, `turn`); the embedded
conversation texts were dropped; rows were sorted for a deterministic snapshot.

This data license (CC-BY-4.0) applies ONLY to the files in this directory. The
judgelab source code is licensed separately (see the repository LICENSE).
